  "description": "A lean MQTT 5 connection server for ASP.NET Core, over WebSockets. It is not a broker: it handles the protocol, QoS 0, 1 and 2, limits, deadlines and shutdown for every connection, and your handler decides who connects, what a subscription means and where each message goes. An idle connection costs it about 600 bytes above a bare ASP.NET Core WebSocket.",
